//
// Allegrex instruction list (integer, FPU, control). X-macro: OP(ID, "mnemonic", KIND)
//
// KIND decides how the interpreter and the recompiler treat the instruction:
//   ALU     straight-line: semantics are sem_ID(Ctx*, u32 insn). May access memory.
//   BR      conditional branch with delay slot: bool cond_ID(Ctx*, u32 insn).
//   BRL     branch-likely (delay slot nullified when not taken).
//   BRAL    branch-and-link (ra = pc+8 unconditionally).
//   BRALL   branch-and-link-likely.
//   J/JAL   absolute 26-bit jumps.  JR/JALR register jumps.
//   SYSCALL, BREAK, ERET, INVALID  handled by the runtime.
//
// The VFPU agent appends vector instructions in vfpu_ops.inc using the same scheme.

